  "title": "Make-Ahead Coconut-Pineapple Muffins",
  "description": "The muffin batter for these not-so-sweet muffins with fresh pineapple and coconut can be made the night before for a no-fuss breakfast the next day.",
  "authors": [
    "Yoly"
  ],
  "date_published": "2021-03-05T00:36:21-05:00",
